# Entity details cards — status + actions header

Use this layout for summary/preview cards that show a **status indicator** (badge, toggle, dot) **and** action buttons (product, cart line, order).

## Header layout

- Outer row: `flex items-start justify-between gap-2` (add `mb-2` when body content follows).
- **Left** (`flex-1 min-w-0`): title (`text-sm font-medium`) + optional subtitle (`text-xs text-muted-foreground`).
- **Right** (`flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0`): **status first**, then action buttons.

## Skeletons

Mirror the same header: title block on the left, status + action skeletons grouped on the right.

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD — status before actions, grouped on the right
<div className="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
  <div className="flex-1 min-w-0">
    <h4 className="text-sm font-medium truncate">{name}</h4>
    <p className="text-xs text-muted-foreground">{subtitle}</p>
  </div>
  <div className="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
    <Badge variant={variant} className="text-xs">{status}</Badge>
    <Button size="sm" variant="ghost" className="size-6 p-0">...</Button>
  </div>
</div>

// ❌ BAD — actions before status, or status outside the right group
<div className="flex items-center gap-2">
  <div className="flex-1">{name}</div>
  <div>{actions}</div>
  <Badge>{status}</Badge>
</div>
```
